        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Restructure import assertions description to ease maintainability]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42309</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42309"/>
        <updated>2025-12-10T07:54:36.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">As discussed in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3708656574" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42306" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42306/hovercard?comment_id=3629944371&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42306#issuecomment-3629944371">#42306 (comment)</a> the description of import assertions does not provide an easy way to link to particular parts of the concepts, such as a definition of CSS Modules imported using <code class="notranslate">with { type: "css"}</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This restructures the existing material to provide some headings. Should allow clean linking to the doc, easier parsing for readers, and maintenance if we later add other module types.</p>
<p dir="auto"><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena">@Josh-Cena</a> Obviously "for discussion and iteration". It is almost all a restructure, with only a tiny amount of new content, which I will highlight.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work being done in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3699248949" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42255" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/42255/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42255">#42255</a></p>]]></content>
