        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Navigation.reload() does not trigger popstate event]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42303</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42303"/>
        <updated>2025-12-09T09:28:52.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #38229.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2862878729" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38229" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/38229/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/38229">#38229</a></p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigation/reload" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Navigation.reload()</code></a> reloads the current page - a soft navigation because data is not fetched from the server. This change adds a note that this action does not fire the <code class="notranslate">popstate</code> event.<br>
<a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/noamr/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/noamr">@noamr</a> Points out that it does fire for other soft navigations, so people might expect it to fire for this one.</p>
<p dir="auto">I "weakly" disagree. If you look at the documentation of <code class="notranslate">popstate</code> it pretty clearly requires a modification to the history stack, which this does not cause. That said, I'm not an expert, and I don't think this does harm.<br>
If the reviewer rejects this I will not be unhappy.</p>
<p dir="auto">This is part of work for <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3699247245" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42254" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/42254/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42254">#42254</a></p>]]></content>
